      "purpose": "Login resolves exact identity."
    }
  ],
  "prose": {
    "summary": "Define `reload ac` as the explicit runtime transition that reloads/activates AccessCore configuration and, where authentication is required, enters the IAM login/authentication flow before governed access continues.",
